00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,680
Got an IBC tote in the garden? Check this out.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:08,240
Using an IBC tote for rainwater? You know the problem.

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:12,760
Sun makes plastic brittle, and algae turn the water green.

4
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,240
This is the fix.

5
00:00:14,240 --> 00:00:18,760
A heavy-duty cover in two hundred ten D Oxford.

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:22,240
It blocks sunlight and UV rays completely.

7
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:24,520
Goes on in two minutes.

8
00:00:24,520 --> 00:00:25,960
Pull the zipper down.

9
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,000
You don't have to take it off to check the water.

10
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,080
There's an opening right over the lid.

11
00:00:33,080 --> 00:00:38,840
The result? Clear water, no algae growth and a tank that lasts longer.

12
00:00:38,840 --> 00:00:42,200
The IBC tote cover.

13
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:44,520
Easy to put on, made to last.
